.* DSPLIB: a library's attributes and its objects.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SIZECL BASETYPE='CHAR 28'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIBTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CRTAUT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=NOBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ASPNUM CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*SYSBAS'.
:VAR NAME=ASPGRP CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*SYSBAS'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=KINDCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ATRSIZE CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OPT OBJ OBJTYPE OBJLIB ATRSIZE OBJTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPLIB KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPLIBH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE BOTSEP=NONE.Display Library
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAC.Library  . . . . . . :   &LIB.
:DATAC.Type . . . . . . . . :   &LIBTYPE.
:DATAC.Create authority . . :   &CRTAUT.
:DATACOL WIDTH=37.
:DATAC.Number of objects  . :   &NOBJ.
:DATAC.Library ASP number . :   &ASPNUM.
:DATAC.Library ASP device . :   &ASPDEV.
:DATAC.Library ASP group  . :   &ASPGRP.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display full attributes
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Display service attributes
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
.* The attribute and the size share a column, as in QUIDSPOBJD.
:LISTCOL VAR=ATRSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute               Size
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPLIBH.Display Library - Help
:P.A library's attributes and every object in it with its size in
bytes. Type 5 or 8 next to an object to see its whole description.
Enter goes on to the next library named, F12 back to the one before.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F17 and F18
move to the top and the bottom of the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
